Translation patch: EdwardsPoint::compress_batch_alloc

Change: `map`/`collect` and `zip`/`map`/`collect` become `for` loops.
Why: Aeneas only models `Iterator::next` (aeneas#1057).
Behaviour: identical.
Relies on: `invert_batch_alloc` takes `&mut [FieldElement]`, so it preserves `zs.len() == inputs.len()`.

